namespace PhrasePlayer {
    public static class HelpText {
        public static string About(string language) {
            return language == "en" ?
                "English Dictation Player\r\nVersion 1.0\r\n\r\nAuthor: ThermoXu\r\nFree to use.\r\n\r\nA lightweight offline Windows player for English dictation.\r\nAutomatic phrase selection, manual ranges, repeats and pitch-preserving speed control.\r\n\r\nOpen-source audio libraries: NAudio and SoundTouch.Net.\r\nLicenses and corresponding SoundTouch source are included with the app." :
                "英语听写播放器\r\n版本 1.0\r\n\r\n作者：ThermoXu\r\n免费使用。\r\n\r\n轻便的 Windows 离线英语听写工具。\r\n支持自动分段、手动选段、片段重复和保持音调的倍速播放。\r\n\r\n使用 NAudio、SoundTouch.Net 开源音频库。\r\n相关许可和 SoundTouch 对应源码随软件提供。";
        }
        public static string Get(string language) {
            return language == "en" ?
                "GETTING STARTED\r\n\r\n1. Open audio or drop a file into the window. MP3, WAV and M4A are supported on standard Windows systems.\r\n2. Audio is split at pauses. Click a phrase, use Previous / Next, or choose one from the list.\r\n3. Drag across the waveform to select any range. Scroll to zoom; use the scrollbar to move through the audio.\r\n4. Set repeats (1 / 2 / 3 / 5 / 10 / Infinite) and gap (0–30 s), then click Play. Use Auto next to proceed after the chosen repeats. Infinite always repeats the current phrase.\r\n5. Speed: 0.5 / 0.8 / 1.0 / 1.2 / 1.5 / 2.0x, with original pitch preserved.\r\n6. Play entire audio starts at the beginning and plays to the end, ignoring phrase repeats and gaps. Pause / Resume and speed still work.\r\n7. Segmentation: set minimum / maximum duration, choose a preset, and optionally merge short phrases into the next phrase. Click Resegment to apply. Long pauses stay apart. This is pause-based splitting, without speech recognition.\r\n8. Settings: choose Default / Dark mode and 中文 / English; save to apply and remember your choice. About lists the author.\r\n\r\nEDITING AND OPTIONAL TOOLS\r\n\r\nMerge next joins two phrases. Click inside a phrase to place the dashed cursor, then Split here (at least 0.1 s on each side). Undo restores up to 20 edits. Edits reset when reopening or resegmenting. Zoom + / Zoom - / Fit all adjust the view; the scrollbar moves through time.\r\nLeading padding in Segmentation defaults to 0.3 s and can be increased to 1 s to retain quiet beginnings.\r\nSettings optionally shows boundary +/-0.1 s controls, or enables adaptive gaps: original phrase duration times the multiplier, capped at 120 s. Both are off by default; adaptive gaps replace the fixed gap and never affect entire-audio playback.\r\n\r\nKEYBOARD SHORTCUTS\r\n\r\nSpace — Play / Pause / Resume; stop during a repeat gap.\r\nLeft / Right — Previous / next phrase.\r\nEnter — Replay the selected phrase from its beginning.\r\nEsc — Stop playback; close a dialog.\r\nF1 — Help.\r\n\r\nWhen editing a dropdown or number, its normal keys take priority. Click the waveform to use playback shortcuts. Switching phrases ends entire-audio playback. Original audio is never changed. Settings are remembered; audio path and playback position are not." :
                "常规操作\r\n\r\n1. 点击“打开音频”，或将文件拖入窗口。普通 Windows 系统支持 MP3、WAV、M4A。\r\n2. 软件按停顿自动分段。单击波形选段，用“上一段 / 下一段”或短语下拉框切换。\r\n3. 在波形上按住左键拖动可自由选取片段；滚轮缩放，下方滚动条浏览时间位置。\r\n4. 设置播放次数（1 / 2 / 3 / 5 / 10 次或无限）和间隔（0–30 秒），点击播放。勾选“播完进入下一段”会在重复完成后切换；无限重复始终停留在当前段。\r\n5. 倍速可选 0.5 / 0.8 / 1.0 / 1.2 / 1.5 / 2.0 倍，保持原音调。\r\n6. “从头播放到尾”从音频开头连续播放到结尾，忽略分段重复和间隔；仍可暂停、继续和调整倍速。\r\n7. 分段设置中可调整最短 / 最长时长、选择常用推荐，并选择合并过短片段。点击“重新分段”生效。长停顿不强行连接，按声音和停顿判断，不识别文字。\r\n8. 设置中可切换默认 / 黑色模式和中文 / English，保存后立即生效并保留。“关于”介绍作者。\r\n\r\n编辑及可选功能\r\n\r\n“合并下一段”连接相邻两段。单击段内放置虚线光标后点“在此拆分”，两侧至少各 0.1 秒。“撤销”最多恢复 20 次编辑。重新打开或重新分段会重置编辑。放大 / 缩小 / 显示全部调整视野，下方滚动条移动时间位置。\r\n分段设置的开头预留默认 0.3 秒，最多 1 秒，可增大以保留较轻的起始发音。\r\n设置可选边界 ±0.1 秒微调，以及自动留白：原始片段时长 × 倍数，最多 120 秒。两项默认关闭；自动留白代替固定间隔，不影响全文连续播放。\r\n\r\n快捷键\r\n\r\n空格：播放 / 暂停 / 继续；重复间隔期间为停止。\r\n← / →：上一段 / 下一段。\r\nEnter：从当前选中片段的开头重新播放。\r\nEsc：停止播放；关闭弹窗。\r\nF1：打开帮助。\r\n\r\n在下拉框和数字输入框内，按键优先用于正常编辑；点击波形后可使用播放快捷键。切换片段会退出全文播放。原音频不会被改写；软件保留设置，不记录上次音频路径和播放进度。";
        }
    }
}
